{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2487710/extras/1410f4572f0ac599bec6de3596136515.avif?t=1771104651\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a first\u2011person adventure alongside Blin Albius, in a world where fantasy blends with science, where every creature carries a story, every plant hides a secret and every biome breathes its own identity, while the narrative unfolds with calm depth and the exploration rewards curiosity with constant discoveries.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE GAME</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EONIA REVELATIONS is an adventure of exploration and discovery, a journey where more than one hundred ingredients from animals, plants and minerals tell their own story while the player advances by drawing, investigating and learning in a colorful world that responds to curiosity with secrets, humor, memorable characters and a deep narrative that uses time as its central axis, growing organically and creating a relaxed, charming and richly layered experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Blin Albius, the last apprentice of a Knowledge Seeker, as you explore the world, solve mysteries, meet allies and rivals and uncover the truth behind the silent conflict among the three Factions that seek to influence the fate of the world, revealing or not the hidden role of the Gods of the Sky.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A LIVING, COHERENT WORLD FULL OF HISTORY</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is composed of six completely distinct sectors, each with its own geography, climate, creatures and secrets, and every element is placed with intention, making exploration feel natural, logical and always rewarding, whether you prefer a direct adventure or enjoy losing yourself in extensive lore filled with detail.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORATION, DRAWING AND CONSTANT PROGRESSION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The heart of the game lies in observing and understanding, in drawing creatures, plants and minerals to expand your knowledge, in identifying ingredients by consulting specialized books and in gathering materials with the appropriate tools, while new abilities unlock as you read books that teach navigation, construction, fishing, cartography, alchemy and many other disciplines that broaden the possibilities of the journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world includes a teleportation system that follows the logic of its lore, allowing you to travel long distances once the world has been mapped, maintaining the fluidity of exploration without breaking the internal coherence of the universe.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>AN EXPERIENCE TO ENJOY AT YOUR OWN PACE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EONIA REVELATIONS is designed as a refuge, a world you can return to whenever you wish to advance a little more, discover something new or simply enjoy a peaceful adventure, with a main story that can be followed without detours and with secondary activities, characters with their own stories and a glossary that grows with every discovery.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ARE YOU READY?</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every discovery pushes you forward and every secret opens a new path. The goal is to explore, investigate and unravel the mysteries the world presents, following trails that require attention, observation and perseverance. The game invites you to begin the journey with determination and to keep moving without discouragement, because every step brings you closer to the final truth.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 A vast world with six completely distinct biomes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Almost one hundred ingredients from creatures, plants and minerals </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 A drawing system to catalog the life of the world </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Knowledge\u2011based gathering, crafting and alchemy </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Books, paintings and songs that expand the lore </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Puzzles, secrets and caves filled with history </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Memorable characters with their own motivations </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Progression based on reading, observation and learning </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Free exploration with lore\u2011consistent teleportation </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 A deep narrative with time as its central theme </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 A relaxed, immersive experience full of discoveries</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2487710?t=1771104651","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2487710/1b9a1146bdd4790695c2cdf22b4bb1cc846faa7a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771104651","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2487710/96a01273369bad3367c5910558d48ef2fc8cd4ad/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771104651","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2487710/96a01273369bad3367c5910558d48ef2fc8cd4ad/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771104651","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4329210,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2487710/extras/1410f4572f0ac599bec6de3596136515.avif?t=1771104651\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a first\u2011person a